      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$",
        "F_Navi(\"Weapon Shop\",\"ayothaya,163,90\",\"^0000FF\")"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nThe {1}\nin Ayothaya has special weapons.\nYou can find great weapons there.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Ayothaya Guide Noi",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$",
        "F_Navi(\"Tool Shop\",\"ayothaya,131,86\",\"^006400\")"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nOur citizens purchase many products in the {1}.\nMake sure you get all you need there.\nDo you need anything else?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Ayothaya Guide Noi",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$",
        "F_Navi(\"Tavern\",\"ayothaya,229,72\",\"^008080\")"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nPart of adventuring is collecting information.\nThe {1} is crowded with lots of travelers where you can get useful information.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Ayothaya Guide Noi",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$",
        "F_Navi(\"Shrine\",\"ayothaya,208,280\",\"^FF1493\")"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nTo calm your heart, go to the {1} and say a prayer.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Ayothaya Guide Noi",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$",
        "F_Navi(\"fishing\",\"ayothaya,255,99\",\"^8B4513\")"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nAyothaya is close to the beach, so most people enjoy fishing.\nThey really love to fish.\nGo {1} and try to grab a big fish.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Ayothaya Guide Noi",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$",
        "F_Navi(\"Aibakthing\",\"ayothaya,151,68\",\"^00BFFF\")"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nIf you want to return home\nfind {1}\nand ask him to send you back.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Ayothaya Guide Noi",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nI'll remove all marks from your mini-map.\nDo you need anything else??"
    },
